  "solution": {
    "text": "Let the stone be projected at an angle α to the direction of motion of truck with a speed of v = 20 m/s.<br /><br />Since the resultant displacement along horizontal is zero.<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0016820_AnsExp_1.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 286px; height: 138px;\" /><br /><br />The velocity along horizontal = 0<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mn>5</mn> <mo>+</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mn>0</mn> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mtext>cos</mtext> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mi>α</mi> <mo>=</mo> <mn>0</mn> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mo>⇒</mo> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mtext>cos</mtext> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mi>α</mi> <mo>=</mo> <mo>-</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>4</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>⇒</mo> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mi>α</mi> <mo>=</mo> <msup> <mtext>cos</mtext> <mn>-1</mn> </msup> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></math>",
